README
======

All rights reserved to NETRADYNE INC

Kernel_modules: This folder consists of source code and kernel module files arranged for build system.
nd.conf: Shall be placed at /etc/modules-load.d/ folder for OS to pickup all modules being specified in the file.

kernel_modules/<module_name>/build : shall hold the build
kernel_modules/<module_name>/code : shall hold the code

for bagheera2

kernel_modules/bagheera2/nd.conf : Shall be placed at /etc/modules-load.d/ folder for OS to pickup all modules being specified in the file.
kernel_modules/bagheera2/<module_name>/build : shall hold the build
kernel_modules/bagheera2/<module_name>/code : shall hold the code
